ready: 1
kind: quality
id: recall.quality.hook-latency
display_id: QC-RECALL-LATENCY
module: recall
title: Hook-path recall latency
applies_to:
  - recall.seq.session-index
  - recall.seq.cue
  - recall.seq.gut-check
measure: Wall time from the hook handler's start to its output, with the daemon running and a stack of 10,000 memories
scope: Session start, prompt submit and pre-tool hooks
target: At most 50 milliseconds at the 95th percentile, and never past the hook deadline
